    <bf:summary>
      <bf:Summary>
	<rdfs:label>"When one of their own makes a mistake, a group of Nova Scotia crafters comes together to create a story to cover it up. But one lie leads to another and someone dies. The crafters have a choice to make. Become the main suspects, or catch the killer themselves"-- Provided by publisher"-- Provided by publisher.</rdfs:label>
      </bf:Summary>
